        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Polar Bear\n- People: Seb Rochford, Pete Wareham, Mark Lockheart, Tom Herbert, Leafcutter John\n- Roles: drummer, tenor saxophone, double bass, electronics, guitar, mandolin\n- Concepts: electronic musical instrument, experimental jazz band\n\nFacts:\n- Polar Bear is a British experimental jazz band.\n- Seb Rochford leads Polar Bear as drummer.\n- Pete Wareham and Mark Lockheart play tenor saxophone in Polar Bear.\n- Tom Herbert plays double bass in Polar Bear.\n- Leafcutter John plays electronics and occasionally guitar or mandolin in Polar Bear.\n- An electronic musical instrument is a musical instrument that produces sound using electronic circuitry and/or digital devices.",
